00:21:11,441 --> 00:21:15,940
property that will extend and soften this batch.

341
00:21:15,941 --> 00:21:19,640
This is an example of the carbon black that's going into the batch.

342
00:21:19,641 --> 00:21:22,640
A very little bit of this goes a very long way.

