00:21:36,241 --> 00:21:39,240
are actually different chemicals.

347
00:21:39,241 --> 00:21:43,240
We've got a little bit of Modern Marvel's Custom Mix 101.

348
00:21:43,241 --> 00:21:47,240
We've taken the materials that we just described,

349
00:21:47,241 --> 00:21:52,240
and we're actually going to use a technique called upside-down mixing,

350
00:21:52,241 --> 00:21:57,240
where we're going to load the carbon black, the balance of the fillers, and plasticizer,

351
00:21:57,241 --> 00:22:02,240
and then load the polymer, the raw synthetic EPDM, last.

352
00:22:02,241 --> 00:22:06,240
Lower the ram, masticate, put this together,

353
00:22:06,241 --> 00:22:10,240
and then based on temperature, we will add the curative

354
00:22:10,241 --> 00:22:15,240
to the mix to get a homogeneous mix.

355
00:22:15,241 --> 00:22:17,240
Akin to making pie crust dough,

356
00:22:17,241 --> 00:22:19,240
all the ingredients for this exclusive recipe

357
00:22:19,241 --> 00:22:22,240
are mashed together and kneaded until pliable.

358
00:22:22,241 --> 00:22:25,240
Then the mixture drops down to a mill that compresses

