00:24:30,900 --> 00:24:34,840
We could re-grind the rolls, put in new bronze bearings,

396
00:24:34,940 --> 00:24:38,420
new gears, of course, and rebuild this, put a new drive

397
00:24:38,520 --> 00:24:42,360
