398
00:24:42,460 --> 00:24:44,120
The durability and brute strength

399
00:24:44,220 --> 00:24:47,160
of equipment like this helped make it possible to overcome

400
00:24:47,161 --> 00:24:50,760
to overcome wartime rubber shortages.

401
00:24:50,761 --> 00:24:53,960
But peace offered no slowdown in the production of natural and

402
00:24:53,961 --> 00:24:57,000
synthetic rubber. The bottom line is the war

403
00:24:57,001 --> 00:24:59,880
was a driver for an awful lot of things in this country.

