00:25:22,760 --> 00:25:25,760
have a car, was going to have perhaps two cars.

412
00:25:25,860 --> 00:25:30,100
And each new car was equipped with five new tires.

413
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:33,000
The rapid rise in tire sales was good news for the small

414
00:25:33,100 --> 00:25:36,020
